@host = https://localhost:7126
@token = PASTE_STAKEHOLDER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Existing product: expect 200 and a photos array
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Product list: each item contains a photos array
GET {{host}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# For upload/download/order/delete, see ProductPhotos.http and docs/product-photos.md.
# Only completed, non-deleted uploads appear in the photos collection.
